 2016 b; vouchers: CNMT 6768!, CNMT 6769! and RB 01017642!). This type of flooded habitat is also known to support other congeneric nothospecies, such as C. × sheyllae Krahl, Cantuária & J. B. F. Silva, recently described from the state of Pará (Cantuária et al., 2021).","","text","",""]]},"V5BZV":{"d":[["IRN","IR","iso","",""],["Fars","","text","",""],["Hormozgan","","text","",""]]},"V8TMN":{"d":[["Type locality. Brazil, Rondonia.","","text","",""]]},"V9QPM":{"d":[["California","","text","",""]]},"VC4MC":{"d":[["Neotropical(Honduras)","","text","",""]]},"VVNC":{"d":[["Zaire (Shaba)","","text","native",""]]},"VZFG":{"d":[["","IN","iso","",""]]},"X2QB":{"d":[["British Columbia","","text","",""],["Colorado","","text","",""],["Idaho","","text","",""],["Nevada","","text","",""],["Oregon","","text","",""],["Utah","","text","",""]]}}